  "question": {
    "text": "If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;(where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></math>) be the roots of the equation <math><msup><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then <math><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></math> is equal to"
  },
